  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ulaanbaatar District Heating Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The main objective of the Ulaanbaatar District Heating Project is to reduce CO2 emissions and local air pollution in the City of Ulaanbaatar by improving the reliability of district heating supply and increasing the networks capacity. Its specific objectives (SO) are to: 1) Improve the reliability of existing and new district heating and hot water supply network; 2) Increase district heating networks capacity; and 3) Improve the corporate governance of the Ulaanbaatar District Heating Company.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
